{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">水務署於尖沙咀海防道進行食水管道維修工程，鄰近一帶的食水受影響。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">現場是海防道新港中心對出，多名水務署工程人員到場維修，懷疑有食水管出現滲留，地底有有積水。水務署稱，海防道、漢口道部分大廈，以及新港中心部分商舖，食水供應受影響。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.PIPE-1900_002.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026VghKxw1in81787397802.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.PIPE-1900_002.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">署方調派水車和水箱到現場，有附近民居住客、食肆職員等到場取水。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.PIPE-1900_001.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026TcpiDH2XMJ1787397772.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.PIPE-1900_001.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-22T11:39:07.413634+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":146,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}